{"seq":1,"slug":"reading-technical-docs","title":"技术文档阅读策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/reading-technical-docs","wordCount":1447,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术文档阅读策略\">技术文档阅读策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术文档不是按顺序从头读到尾的文章——它是<strong>按需取用的工具</strong>。阅读效率的差异，本质上来自是否知道&quot;哪类文档该用什么读法、该提取什么信息&quot;。</p>\n<p>三类文档对应三套不同的阅读契约：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规范类文档（RFC）</strong>：核心是<strong>模态动词</strong>（MUST / SHOULD / MAY）。读懂强制等级就读懂了协议，逐字精读正文反而是浪费</li>\n<li><strong>API 文档</strong>：核心是<strong>端点与参数的结构</strong>。按&quot;认证 → 快速上手 → 目标端点 → 错误处理&quot;的顺序跳读，而非顺序通读</li>\n<li><strong>设计文档（ADR / 内部 RFC）</strong>：核心是<strong>决策与其后果</strong>。读 Status / Context / Decision / Consequences，跳过实现细节</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[技术文档阅读] --&gt; B[规范类 RFC]&#10;    A --&gt; C[API 文档]&#10;    A --&gt; D[设计文档 ADR]&#10;    B --&gt; E[抓模态动词]&#10;    B --&gt; F[MUST SHOULD MAY 分级]&#10;    C --&gt; G[按需跳读端点]&#10;    C --&gt; H[认证-上手-端点-错误]&#10;    D --&gt; I[读决策与后果]&#10;    D --&gt; J[Status Context Decision Consequences]&#10;    E --&gt; K[提取所需信息即止]&#10;    F --&gt; K&#10;    G --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[技术文档阅读] --&gt; B[规范类 RFC]\n    A --&gt; C[API 文档]\n    A --&gt; D[设计文档 ADR]\n    B --&gt; E[抓模态动词]\n    B --&gt; F[MUST SHOULD MAY 分级]\n    C --&gt; G[按需跳读端点]\n    C --&gt; H[认证-上手-端点-错误]\n    D --&gt; I[读决策与后果]\n    D --&gt; J[Status Context Decision Consequences]\n    E --&gt; K[提取所需信息即止]\n    F --&gt; K\n    G --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K</pre><p>无论哪类文档，阅读的共同底层能力都是<strong>识别英语句型</strong>——定义、条件、因果各有固定句式；再配合一个按领域分类的个人术语库，就能把&quot;读得慢&quot;变成&quot;读得准&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rfc-文档阅读方法\">RFC 文档阅读方法</h2><p>RFC（Request for Comments）是互联网协议的权威规范来源。作为开发者，你迟早要阅读 HTTP/2 规范、WebSocket 协议或 OAuth 2.0 授权框架的 RFC。这类文档以严谨著称，有一套独特的结构和用语体系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rfc-的标准结构\">RFC 的标准结构</h3><p>一篇典型的 RFC 包含以下主要章节：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>阅读优先级</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>摘要</td>\n<td>Abstract</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n<td>一段话概括整个规范内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引言</td>\n<td>Introduction</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n<td>背景、动机、适用范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术语</td>\n<td>Terminology / Definitions</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n<td>关键术语定义，后续阅读的基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概述</td>\n<td>Overview / Architecture</td>\n<td>★★☆</td>\n<td>系统整体设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>详细规范</td>\n<td>Specification / Protocol Details</td>\n<td>★☆☆</td>\n<td>按需查阅的具体细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全考量</td>\n<td>Security Considerations</td>\n<td>★★☆</td>\n<td>安全相关注意事项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考文献</td>\n<td>References</td>\n<td>★☆☆</td>\n<td>相关规范的引用链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"rfc-2119-关键词体系\">RFC 2119 关键词体系</h3><p>RFC 中的模态动词有严格的语义等级定义（RFC 2119）。理解这些关键词是正确实现协议的前提：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键词</th>\n<th>强制等级</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>实现要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MUST / SHALL / REQUIRED</td>\n<td>绝对强制</td>\n<td>必须遵守</td>\n<td>不实现则不合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MUST NOT / SHALL NOT</td>\n<td>绝对禁止</td>\n<td>严禁违反</td>\n<td>实现了则不合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHOULD / RECOMMENDED</td>\n<td>强烈建议</td>\n<td>推荐遵守，除非有充分理由</td>\n<td>应实现，例外需记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHOULD NOT / NOT RECOMMENDED</td>\n<td>不建议</td>\n<td>不推荐，除非确有需要</td>\n<td>应避免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAY / OPTIONAL</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>完全由实现者决定</td>\n<td>可实现可不实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际应用示例（摘自 HTTP/1.1 规范）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;A client MUST send a Host header field in all HTTP/1.1 request messages.&quot;&#10;→ 客户端必须在所有 HTTP/1.1 请求中包含 Host 头，不发就是协议违规。&#10;&#10;&quot;A server SHOULD send a Date header field in all responses.&quot;&#10;→ 服务器强烈建议在响应中带上 Date 头，但特殊场景可以省略。&#10;&#10;&quot;An origin server MAY include a Cache-Control header in a response.&quot;&#10;→ 源服务器可以自行决定是否在响应中包含 Cache-Control。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"A client MUST send a Host header field in all HTTP/1.1 request messages.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 客户端必须在所有 HTTP/1.1 请求中包含 Host 头，不发就是协议违规。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"A server SHOULD send a Date header field in all responses.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 服务器强烈建议在响应中带上 Date 头，但特殊场景可以省略。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"An origin server MAY include a Cache-Control header in a response.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 源服务器可以自行决定是否在响应中包含 Cache-Control。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"rfc-高效阅读策略\">RFC 高效阅读策略</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>先读 Abstract + Introduction</strong>——判断是否是你需要的规范</li>\n<li><strong>精读 Terminology</strong>——在纸上记下关键定义，后续阅读不再回头查</li>\n<li><strong>跳到 Overview/Architecture 看全局图</strong>——理解协议的整体流程</li>\n<li><strong>按需精读 Specification 的特定小节</strong>——不要从头读到尾</li>\n<li><strong>交叉参考 Security Considerations</strong>——了解协议的已知安全约束</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"api-文档阅读技巧\">API 文档阅读技巧</h2><p>API 文档是开发者每天接触最频繁的技术文档类型。掌握其结构约定能大幅提升集成新服务的效率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"api-文档的标准结构\">API 文档的标准结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"API Reference&#10;├── Authentication         # 认证方式（API Key, OAuth, JWT）&#10;├── Base URL              # 服务端点&#10;├── Rate Limiting         # 频率限制说明&#10;├── Errors                # 错误码和错误响应格式&#10;├── Resources             # 按资源分组的端点&#10;│   ├── Users&#10;│   │   ├── List users        GET /users&#10;│   │   ├── Get user          GET /users/:id&#10;│   │   ├── Create user       POST /users&#10;│   │   └── Delete user       DELETE /users/:id&#10;│   └── Orders&#10;│       └── ...&#10;└── Webhooks              # 事件通知\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>API Reference</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Authentication         # 认证方式（API Key, OAuth, JWT）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Base URL              # 服务端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Rate Limiting         # 频率限制说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Errors                # 错误码和错误响应格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Resources             # 按资源分组的端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── List users        GET /users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Get user          GET /users/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Create user       POST /users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── Delete user       DELETE /users/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Webhooks              # 事件通知</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"api-文档中的关键表达\">API 文档中的关键表达</h3><p><strong>参数说明的常见格式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required</td>\n<td>必填参数</td>\n<td><code>email</code> (Required) — string</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optional</td>\n<td>可选参数</td>\n<td><code>page</code> (Optional) — integer, default: 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deprecated</td>\n<td>已废弃</td>\n<td><code>v1_token</code> (Deprecated) — use <code>access_token</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read-only</td>\n<td>只读字段</td>\n<td><code>created_at</code> (Read-only) — ISO 8601</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write-only</td>\n<td>只写字段</td>\n<td><code>password</code> (Write-only) — string</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>响应码描述的标准用语</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"200 OK — The request was successful.&#10;201 Created — The resource was successfully created.&#10;204 No Content — The request was successful but no content is returned.&#10;400 Bad Request — The request was malformed or invalid.&#10;401 Unauthorized — Authentication is required and has failed.&#10;403 Forbidden — You do not have permission to access this resource.&#10;404 Not Found — The requested resource does not exist.&#10;429 Too Many Requests — Rate limit exceeded. Retry after X seconds.&#10;500 Internal Server Error — An unexpected error occurred on the server.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>200 OK — The request was successful.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>201 Created — The resource was successfully created.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>204 No Content — The request was successful but no content is returned.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>400 Bad Request — The request was malformed or invalid.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>401 Unauthorized — Authentication is required and has failed.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>403 Forbidden — You do not have permission to access this resource.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>404 Not Found — The requested resource does not exist.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>429 Too Many Requests — Rate limit exceeded. Retry after X seconds.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>500 Internal Server Error — An unexpected error occurred on the server.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"快速定位技巧\">快速定位技巧</h3><p>面对一个新的 API 文档时的阅读顺序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Authentication</strong>——首先弄清楚如何获得访问权限</li>\n<li><strong>Quickstart / Getting Started</strong>——如果有，先走通最简示例</li>\n<li><strong>目标端点</strong>——直接跳到你需要调用的资源章节</li>\n<li><strong>Error Handling</strong>——了解可能遇到的错误和处理方式</li>\n<li><strong>Rate Limits</strong>——确认调用频率限制，避免被封</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"架构文档与设计文档\">架构文档与设计文档</h2><h3 id=\"adr-architecture-decision-record-的阅读\">ADR（Architecture Decision Record）的阅读</h3><p>ADR 是记录架构决策的标准格式，在大型项目中广泛使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR 001: Use PostgreSQL as Primary Database&#10;&#10;## Status&#10;&#10;Accepted&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;We need a database that supports complex queries, transactions, and scales well for our current data model of approximately 10M records with 50+ joins.&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;We will use PostgreSQL 16 as our primary relational database.&#10;&#10;## Consequences&#10;&#10;- Good: Strong ACID compliance, rich query capabilities&#10;- Good: Excellent community support and tooling&#10;- Bad: Vertical scaling limits compared to NoSQL options&#10;- Bad: Schema migrations require careful coordination\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR 001: Use PostgreSQL as Primary Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Accepted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">We need a database that supports complex queries, transactions, and scales well for our current data model of approximately 10M records with 50+ joins.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">We will use PostgreSQL 16 as our primary relational database.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Consequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good: Strong ACID compliance, rich query capabilities</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Good: Excellent community support and tooling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad: Vertical scaling limits compared to NoSQL options</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bad: Schema migrations require careful coordination</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键阅读要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Status</strong>——Proposed / Accepted / Deprecated / Superseded</li>\n<li><strong>Context</strong>——决策的背景和约束条件</li>\n<li><strong>Decision</strong>——做了什么选择</li>\n<li><strong>Consequences</strong>——正面和负面后果</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"rfc-内部设计文档-的常见结构\">RFC（内部设计文档）的常见结构</h3><p>注意：此处的 RFC 指的是公司内部的 Request for Comments（设计提案），不是 IETF RFC：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# RFC: Implement Real-time Notification System&#10;&#10;## Summary&#10;&#10;One-paragraph description of what this RFC proposes.&#10;&#10;## Motivation&#10;&#10;Why are we doing this? What problem does this solve?&#10;&#10;## Detailed Design&#10;&#10;Technical details of the proposed solution.&#10;&#10;## Alternatives Considered&#10;&#10;Other approaches we evaluated and why we rejected them.&#10;&#10;## Rollout Plan&#10;&#10;How we plan to deploy and migrate.&#10;&#10;## Open Questions&#10;&#10;Unresolved issues for discussion.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># RFC: Implement Real-time Notification System</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Summary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">One-paragraph description of what this RFC proposes.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Motivation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Why are we doing this? What problem does this solve?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Detailed Design</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Technical details of the proposed solution.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Alternatives Considered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Other approaches we evaluated and why we rejected them.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Rollout Plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">How we plan to deploy and migrate.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Open Questions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Unresolved issues for discussion.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"技术阅读的英语句型识别\">技术阅读的英语句型识别</h2><h3 id=\"定义句型\">定义句型</h3><p>在技术文档中，以下句型用于定义概念：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;X is defined as...&quot;           — X 被定义为...&#10;&quot;X refers to...&quot;               — X 指的是...&#10;&quot;X denotes...&quot;                 — X 表示...&#10;&quot;By X, we mean...&quot;             — 所谓 X，我们指的是...&#10;&quot;X, hereinafter referred to as Y&quot; — X，以下简称 Y\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"X is defined as...\"           — X 被定义为...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"X refers to...\"               — X 指的是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"X denotes...\"                 — X 表示...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"By X, we mean...\"             — 所谓 X，我们指的是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"X, hereinafter referred to as Y\" — X，以下简称 Y</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"条件与例外句型\">条件与例外句型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Unless otherwise specified...&quot;    — 除非另有规定...&#10;&quot;In the absence of X...&quot;         — 如果没有 X...&#10;&quot;Provided that...&quot;               — 前提是...&#10;&quot;Except as noted in Section 3...&quot;  — 除第 3 节提到的情况...&#10;&quot;If and only if...&quot;              — 当且仅当...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Unless otherwise specified...\"    — 除非另有规定...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"In the absence of X...\"         — 如果没有 X...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Provided that...\"               — 前提是...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Except as noted in Section 3...\"  — 除第 3 节提到的情况...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"If and only if...\"              — 当且仅当...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"因果关系句型\">因果关系句型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;This is due to...&quot;             — 这是因为...&#10;&quot;As a result of...&quot;             — 作为...的结果&#10;&quot;This implies that...&quot;          — 这意味着...&#10;&quot;Consequently, ...&quot;             — 因此...&#10;&quot;This is necessary to ensure...&quot; — 这是为了确保...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"This is due to...\"             — 这是因为...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"As a result of...\"             — 作为...的结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This implies that...\"          — 这意味着...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Consequently, ...\"             — 因此...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This is necessary to ensure...\" — 这是为了确保...</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构建个人技术词汇库\">构建个人技术词汇库</h2><p>建立一个按领域分类的术语笔记系统，遇到不确定的词就记下来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>上下文</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>idempotent</td>\n<td>HTTP spec</td>\n<td>多次执行结果相同</td>\n<td>RFC 7231</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>opaque</td>\n<td>Auth tokens</td>\n<td>对客户端不透明，不应解析</td>\n<td>OAuth 2.0 RFC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ephemeral</td>\n<td>Container docs</td>\n<td>短暂的，用完即销毁</td>\n<td>Docker 文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>deterministic</td>\n<td>Algorithm</td>\n<td>相同输入必产生相同输出</td>\n<td>CS 教材</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>长期坚持这个习惯，你会建立起一套精准的技术英语词汇网络，阅读速度和理解深度都会显著提升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>技术文档是&quot;按需取用的工具&quot;，阅读效率取决于能否匹配文档类型选用对的读法</li>\n<li>RFC 类规范：抓 RFC 2119 模态动词（MUST / SHOULD / MAY）的强制等级，先读 Abstract + Introduction + Terminology，再按需精读正文</li>\n<li>API 文档：按&quot;认证 → 快速上手 → 目标端点 → 错误处理 → 速率限制&quot;跳读，识别 Required / Optional / Deprecated 等参数标注与标准响应码用语</li>\n<li>设计文档（ADR / 内部 RFC）：读 Status / Context / Decision / Consequences，重点在决策依据与后果而非实现细节</li>\n<li>通用底层能力是识别英语句型：定义句（<code>X refers to...</code>）、条件例外句（<code>Unless otherwise specified...</code>）、因果句（<code>This is due to...</code>）</li>\n<li>建立按领域分类的个人术语库（术语 / 上下文 / 含义 / 出处），是长期提速的关键</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术文档阅读策略","id":"技术文档阅读策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RFC 文档阅读方法","id":"rfc-文档阅读方法"},{"level":3,"text":"RFC 的标准结构","id":"rfc-的标准结构"},{"level":3,"text":"RFC 2119 关键词体系","id":"rfc-2119-关键词体系"},{"level":3,"text":"RFC 高效阅读策略","id":"rfc-高效阅读策略"},{"level":2,"text":"API 文档阅读技巧","id":"api-文档阅读技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"API 文档的标准结构","id":"api-文档的标准结构"},{"level":3,"text":"API 文档中的关键表达","id":"api-文档中的关键表达"},{"level":3,"text":"快速定位技巧","id":"快速定位技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"架构文档与设计文档","id":"架构文档与设计文档"},{"level":3,"text":"ADR（Architecture Decision Record）的阅读","id":"adr-architecture-decision-record-的阅读"},{"level":3,"text":"RFC（内部设计文档）的常见结构","id":"rfc-内部设计文档-的常见结构"},{"level":2,"text":"技术阅读的英语句型识别","id":"技术阅读的英语句型识别"},{"level":3,"text":"定义句型","id":"定义句型"},{"level":3,"text":"条件与例外句型","id":"条件与例外句型"},{"level":3,"text":"因果关系句型","id":"因果关系句型"},{"level":2,"text":"构建个人技术词汇库","id":"构建个人技术词汇库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"领域术语与命名模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/code-naming-conventions/domain-naming-patterns"},"next":{"title":"PR 与 Code Review 英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/pr-code-review-english"}}